CORE gcc-only
chk.c

^\[__builtin___vsnprintf_chk\.precondition\.1\] line \d+ vsnprintf buffer overflow: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The fortified vsnprintf requires that size does not exceed the object size,
unless that is unknown ((size_t)-1). Only the second call violates this.
